<title>ROMANIA: Romanian producer prices 4.8 pct up in August.</title>
<headline>Romanian producer prices 4.8 pct up in August.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 4.8 percent in August from the previous month and by 59 percent year-on-year, National Statistics Board data showed on Monday.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	 AUGUST    JULY    AUGUST 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change			+4.8    +13.2	+1.6</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+2.0    +36.6	+0.1</p>
<p>  processing industry		+5.6     +7.9	+1.8</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +1.3    +47.9	+1.5</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
